    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heatwave is a <strong>2d fighting game</strong> and <strong>visual novel</strong>, set many years after apocalyptic heatwaves have made most of the Earth uninhabitable. Now, humanity is split between Earth, the Moon, and the Underworld...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of 15+ unique fighters in classic game modes, such as Arcade, Survival, Local Vs, Combo Trial, and more! Then, discover their stories through a  visual novel story mode! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980420/extras/bb220d437f9044af0896ac3ca2994fff.avif?t=1749489319\" width=470 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose between 3 unique fighting styles, which drastically change how the game plays!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Speed Mode:</strong> A fast, movement and combo based fighting mode, geared towards beginners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Mode:</strong>  Limited movement and cancels, but a stronger parry, higher damage, and special overdrive state to compensate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Team Mode:</strong> Instead of an assist, pick a second character to fight alongside, and gain access to powerful setups and pressure by switching places with them. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980420/extras/b064b581aa7e9294a79b20b7c8318a29.avif?t=1749489319\" width=470 height=90 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heatwave is a <strong>2d fighting game</strong> and <strong>visual novel</strong>, set many years after apocalyptic heatwaves have made most of the Earth uninhabitable. Now, humanity is split between Earth, the Moon, and the Underworld...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of 15+ unique fighters in classic game modes, such as Arcade, Survival, Local Vs, Combo Trial, and more! Then, discover their stories through a  visual novel story mode! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980420/extras/bb220d437f9044af0896ac3ca2994fff.avif?t=1749489319\" width=470 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose between 3 unique fighting styles, which drastically change how the game plays!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Speed Mode:</strong> A fast, movement and combo based fighting mode, geared towards beginners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Mode:</strong>  Limited movement and cancels, but a stronger parry, higher damage, and special overdrive state to compensate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Team Mode:</strong> Instead of an assist, pick a second character to fight alongside, and gain access to powerful setups and pressure by switching places with them. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980420/extras/b064b581aa7e9294a79b20b7c8318a29.avif?t=1749489319\" width=470 height=90 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Heatwave is a fast paced 2d fighting game with multiple fighting styles, characters, and assists to choose from, and a visual novel that details the story of those characters, in a distant, post apocalyptic future.",
